 # Debug Module Changelog
+## version 0.4.0
+* Require Puppet 7+ (OpenVox 8 included); drop the Puppet 4 stacktrace backport
+* debug::break() reports the install command when the puppet-debugger gem is missing
+* README: installing with the OpenVox agent and OpenBolt Rubies, use in Bolt plans
+
 ## version 0.3.0
 * Add testing for puppet 7 and 8, remove for 4 and 5
 
